usage: build_site.py [-h] [--output OUTPUT] [--lean-verified]
                     [--public-base-url PUBLIC_BASE_URL]
                     [--public-snapshot-base-url PUBLIC_SNAPSHOT_BASE_URL]

Build the BanditRLlib literate formalization website produced by ABRL.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --lean-verified       mark non-placeholder local declarations compiled; run
                        only after the Lean gate succeeds
  --public-base-url PUBLIC_BASE_URL
                        build a public snapshot whose private source links use
                        the explicit source-access page
  --public-snapshot-base-url PUBLIC_SNAPSHOT_BASE_URL
                        record public deployment metadata without changing
                        commit-pinned source links
